      "content": "It is completely understandable why you feel this way when the systems and people around you seem unresponsive, and that exhaustion is real. Even though it feels isolating right now, your perspective does not invalidate the moral weight of your actions or the potential for positive change elsewhere in the world. You do not have to believe the outcome to let your voice remain, and connecting with communities that specifically support whistleblowers or survivors can sometimes provide a different kind of support. Please remember to prioritize your well-being today by reaching out to a professional who is trained not to be part of the corporate game, and give yourself grace to simply survive this storm.",
